---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
import Testimonials from '../components/Testimonials.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Services | Sunbeam Consulting" description="AI strategy and fractional leadership for startups. Fractional Head of AI, AI Strategy Sprint, and Executive Coaching offerings.">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">How I Help</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-12">
        I help startup leaders shape, prioritize, and execute their AI strategy.
        Three focused offerings, depending on where you are.
      </p>

      <!-- A bit about me -->
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-sunbeam-300 pl-4 mb-16 max-w-3xl">
        <strong class="text-slate-900">A bit about me.</strong> 20+ years in ML, PhD from
        MIT, 2x startup CTO. I've shipped AI in travel, digital rights, fintech, health,
        and insurance, and lived every failure mode along the way.
        <a href="/about" class="text-sunbeam-600 hover:text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">More about how I got here &rarr;</a>
      </p>

      <!-- Fractional Head of AI -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Fractional Head of AI</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          AI leadership without the full-time hire. I shape and prioritize your AI
          roadmap, and help your team execute, embedded with you from strategy
          through shipping.
        </p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">What's Included</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> AI/ML strategy, roadmap, and architecture design</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Hands-on guidance for building ML or GenAI-powered applications (agents, evals, prompt design)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Translating the latest ML & AI research into what matters for your team</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Team coaching and unblocking</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Board and investor prep</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Hiring strategy for AI roles</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Best For</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Teams building GenAI applications for the first time</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Startups without a senior AI leader</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Engineering teams that need clearer AI direction</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Founders preparing for fundraising</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Companies where AI experiments haven't shipped</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-sunbeam-400 hover:bg-sunbeam-500 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
          Discuss This Option
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- AI Strategy Sprint -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">AI Strategy Sprint</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold text-lg mb-6">5 weeks</p>

        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          5 weeks to a clear AI strategy. Stakeholder discovery, competitive review,
          and a written strategy document your board and team
          can rally behind.
        </p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Written AI Strategy Document</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> AI opportunity assessment</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Roadmap of product enhancements and new bets</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Decision-making framework for evaluating AI opportunities</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Board and investor-ready narrative</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Best For</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Teams that need clarity before committing</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Founders prepping for a fundraise</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Companies exploring AI for the first time</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Boards asking "what's our AI strategy?"</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-sunbeam-400 hover:bg-sunbeam-500 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
          Book a Sprint
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Executive Coaching for CTOs -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Executive Coaching</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold text-lg mb-6">Limited openings</p>

        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          1-on-1 coaching for technical founders and leaders, grounded in what I've
          learned as a 2x AI/ML CTO and from coaching CTOs through the hard moments.
          We work on the things that actually take up your headspace: the people
          decision you've been avoiding, the patterns that are making you grumpy,
          when to push and when to nudge, leading through tech and markets that won't
          sit still. You'll leave each session with more clarity, less noise in your
          head, and a couple of concrete things to try this week.
        </p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">What We Work On</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> The hard people calls and tough conversations</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Delegation, and building trust</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Founder stress and the stories that drive it</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Setting clear success criteria and building teams that consistently ship</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Knowing when to ship an experiment vs. kill it</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Best For</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> CTOs growing into the role</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> AI/ML leaders whose roadmap depends on tech that's still moving</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-sunbeam-500 mt-0.5">→</span> Leaders looking for a perspective shift from someone who's been there</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic mb-6">I take on a very limited number of coaching clients.</p>

        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-sunbeam-400 hover:bg-sunbeam-500 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
          Inquire About Coaching
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">What industries do you work with?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">I'm vertical-agnostic. Current and recent work spans B2B SaaS, consumer marketplaces, and early-stage startups. The common thread is companies where AI is becoming central to product direction or fundraising.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">What stage companies do you work with?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Seed to scale-up. At this stage, AI decisions have outsized impact, and the wrong direction can burn months of runway.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Do you write code?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Sometimes, but that's not the primary value. I focus on strategy, direction, and making sure your team is building the right thing in the right way. When needed, I can get hands-on with architecture and technical decisions.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">How do we get started?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Book an intro call. We'll talk about where you are, what you're trying to accomplish, and whether there's a fit. No pitch, just a conversation.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Can we start with a Sprint and then move to Fractional?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Absolutely. Many clients start with a Sprint to get clarity, then continue with fractional engagement for execution. It's a natural progression.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Testimonials />
  <CTASection />
</BaseLayout>
